// Generated Quake sound definitions
// Based on the provided original sound list and the uploaded syntax manifest.
// Uses only paths explicitly present in the provided list.
// Strategy:
// - group natural variations into one logical sound where multiple samples exist
// - keep ambient/world loops as looped ambient defs
// - use mostly implicit single-layer definitions for simplicity and parser safety

